{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o054b","title":"曹真议伐蜀曹叡从计亲送","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o054b-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"曹真议伐蜀曹叡从计亲送","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o054b-q"]},{"id":"huanchen-a-2f76508d00e9a911c6c1","label":"正文","text":"真表伐蜀群陈不便帝从之","evidence":["huanchen-q-179e2d14545cf8b1b742"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0038","role":"议征","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o054b-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"从议亲送","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o054b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0394","role":"陈不便、帝从群议","evidence":["huanchen-q-179e2d14545cf8b1b742"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":230,"label":"太和四年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y230","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o054","basis":"太和四年"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o054b-q","xiahoucao-q-o054","xiahoucao-q-b-c3b845f8b9b9db894d8f"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o054b-q","source_order":[9,224,"O054b"],"order":2247}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0038","name":"曹真","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0394","name":"陈群","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huanchen-q-179e2d14545cf8b1b742","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-fc8a1c727891f36fddb4","layer":"original","quote":"太和中，曹真表欲数道伐蜀，从斜谷入〖14〗。群以为：“太祖昔到阳平攻张鲁〖15〗，多收豆麦以益军粮，鲁未下而食犹乏。今既无所因〖16〗；且斜谷阻险，难以进退。转运必见抄截，多留兵守要，则损战士，不可不熟虑也。”帝从群议","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o054b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e405025b6062f7254d41","layer":"original","quote":"真以“蜀连出侵边境，宜遂伐之；数道并入，可大克也”。帝从其计。真当发西讨，帝亲临送。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":223,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-c3b845f8b9b9db894d8f","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-c3b845f8b9b9db894d8f","layer":"modern","quote":"〖17〗四年：太和四年（公元 230）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":244,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fe1a8be5e95866a7e64a","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o054","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e405025b6062f7254d41","layer":"original","quote":"四年〖17〗，朝洛阳，迁大司马，赐剑履上殿，入朝不趋。真以“蜀连出侵边境，宜遂伐之；数道并入，可大克也”。帝从其计。真当发西讨，帝亲临送。真以八月发长安，从子午道南入；司马宣王溯汉水〖18〗，当会南郑；诸军或从斜谷道，或从武威入〖19〗。会大霖雨三十余日，或栈道断绝〖20〗，诏真还军。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":223,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
